    "Local reminders at 9:00 — 30 days, 1 week, 1 day, and the day of the deadline. These are regular notifications, not Critical Alerts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local reminders at 9:00 — 30 days, 1 week, 1 day, and the day of the deadline. These are regular notifications, not Critical Alerts."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "9:00にローカル通知（30日前・1週間前・1日前・当日）。通常の通知で、重大な通知（Critical Alerts）ではありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "於 9:00 發出本地提醒：截止日期前 30 日、1 星期、1 日，以及當天。這些是一般通知，不是「重要提示」（Critical Alerts）。"
          }
        }
      }
